    "date_note": "Helsingin Sanomat and Yle state the body was found on 14 December 1991; Alibi 4/92 quoted in the thread reports the forensic estimate that death occurred between 6 and 12 November 1991, with the last confirmed sighting on 9 November 1991. No exact day was established.",
    "status": "unsolved",
    "outcome": "A 38-year-old Finnish-born man living in Sweden was arrested in April 1992 and charged with the murder, but Kajaani raastuvanoikeus dismissed the charge for lack of evidence in June 1992 and the hovioikeus did not change the decision; the case remains open with the KRP.",
